[{"title":"送蔡景繁赴淮南运使","author":"刘摰","text":"新堤洛水东风峭，下入长淮春浩渺。\n淮南使者蓬莱仙，叠鼓鸣铙画船晓。\n旦时契阔慕声名，晚岁绸缪亲纻缟。\n磨铅并直登瀛州，对案同厅佐京兆。\n青蒿长松惭异质，流水高山喜同调。\n虽当倥偬喧嚣中，不废樽罍与吟啸。\n岁月扑面来纷纷，冠盖送客声扰扰。\n北园去岁赋红梅，南浦今春歌碧草。\n黄金龙节使光华，白面书生才缥缈。\n世高台阁与省府，偏历从容誉清劭。\n投虚馀刃无足为，澄清百城付谈笑。\n时行有命又有义，所遇何多亦何少。\n未应刻意怀轩裳，知有高情在鱼鸟。\n黄鹄千岁凌长风，奈此沙边老鸧鸨。\n朝廷羽仪重人物，行闻追锋赐严召。\n玉音寄我其无忘，时有归鸿下云表。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44282,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"酬寄","author":"刘摰","text":"赵郎趁我弛担初，为寄肘后杨炎书。\n盈编专备瘴岭病，仁及来世功谁如。\n城南老庐有别舍，我来埽榻成燕居。\n坐忘不复一念起，寸田自治何须锄。\n养生防患不知此，从事方药亦已疏。\n飞鸢未妨随溪水，黄茅正使侵庭除。\n玄膺晨漱已可饱，脯膳况复馀米鱼。\n聊将此书一过读，寄语庶不忧乡闾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44283,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"跋览前此唱和诗卷有诗次其韵","author":"刘摰","text":"穷不废诗真技痒，笔研风云日相向。\n圣贤发愤乃有作，三千馀篇自古上。\n荒城谁我同此声，惟有哀猿啸青嶂。\n穷人所作诚已难，平淡丰腴乃嘉唱。\n横槊壮气虽萧萧，击钵争先犹行行。\n敢怀修门成怨骚，亦防饭颗嘲苦相。\n江湖千里山千重，朝夕供吟纷万状。\n闲适非以娱时人，可口甘酸劳酝酿。\n大儿归不开卷轴，喜我穷通心已忘。\n种瓜颇欲学东陵，醉尉亦从呵故将。\n古人能轻万户侯，为有千篇相等量。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44284,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再作","author":"刘摰","text":"何事劳心四愁望，侧身泰山日东向。\n君子九夷犹可居，已谋筑室金溪上。\n距江蓝舆才两舍，绕郭屏风列千嶂。\n门中翰墨傅风流，自为师友相赓唱。\n曹氏声名父子间，谢家文章弟兄行。\n古人至乐盖在斯，得意未肯博公相。\n顿挫万象归毫端，雕刻丹青尽名状。\n古风严重周庙鼎，小律软美楚人酿。\n居人恻恻盈锦囊，游子篇篇出惊浪。\n苦心颇恨语不工，故实仍嗟老多忘。\n惫休矍铄空据鞍，锐勇终输少年将。\n主盟定霸益勉旃，少陵勋名何可量。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44285,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"长句送跂之官蕲水","author":"刘摰","text":"前年东秦夏六月，望日拜恩初赐玦。\n降秩削职迁黄州，仓皇束装三日发。\n故国东平不入城，北山一夜辞松栝。\n亲朋问讯若梦寐，骨肉分留作胡越。\n论罪岂合有民社，抵谳正欲加鈇钺。\n仇家之议不尽用，天地宽仁日月察。\n才令分司置之蕲，上表谢恩秋已末。\n以御魑魅乃其分，欲居蛮夷圣犹屑。\n蕲也虽僻自善地，回环山溪富林樾。\n平生雅志在江湖，颇与蕲人相缔结。\n收拾孥属已团聚，南北无心更分别。\n白鱼煮玉粳炊珠，佐以秋菘与春蕨。\n筑室求田虽未就，典衣卖装略无阙。\n大谬不然心已忘，笑人非工已愈拙。\n人生端若梦栩栩，事去何庸书咄咄。\n大儿调邑换江南，要虽分房无远别。\n地劣两舍不宿舂，晨起为书午可达。\n邑四万户号难治，民杂江闽吏贪猾。\n锄彊洗恶勿著意，鱼逃至清人忌洁。\n化以诚心磨以久，教而后刑不怨杀。\n得闻无毁亦无誉，以慰萧萧双白发。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44286,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"易元吉画猿","author":"刘摰","text":"槲林秋叶青玉繁，枝间倒挂秋山猿。\n古面睢盱露瘦月，氄毛匀腻舒玄云。\n老猿顾子稍留滞，小猿引臂劳攀援。\n坐疑跳踯避人去，彷佛悲啸生壁间。\n巴山楚峡几千里，寒岩数丈移秋轩。\n渺然独起林壑志，平生愿得与彼群。\n吾知画者古有说，神鬼为易犬马难。\n物之有象众所识，难以伪笔淆其真。\n传闻易生近已死，此笔遂绝无几存。\n安得千金买遗纸，真伪常与识者论。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44287,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋日县斋","author":"刘摰","text":"节物秋将半，疏慵日益加。\n不为投劾去，徒有折腰嗟。\n味酒怀江鳜，乘风忆海槎。\n东篱满凉露，已约伴黄花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44288,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九日再招赵湜","author":"刘摰","text":"夜露感庭鹤，秋风吹海槎。\n相思悲岁月，寂坐望云霞。\n终夕孤蟾魄，重阳近落花。\n君无鄙贫令，金蕊遍陶家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44289,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和移居二首 其一","author":"刘摰","text":"作邑风流在，新居卜筑完。\n清欢橐书入，小隐奉亲安。\n日淡城楼晓，霜深囿树寒。\n吏涂何所得，试向静中看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44290,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和移居二首 其二","author":"刘摰","text":"境物生新趣，蒿榛失旧墟。\n避尘深户牖，待月广阶除。\n醉梦飞鸿外，吟怀晚雪馀。\n相思岁将晏，谁叩草玄居。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44291,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"登徐州城楼","author":"刘摰","text":"彭城楼上望，旷然今古怀。\n山形东负岱，河势下通淮。\n白鸟孤云并，荒烟万木排。\n吾观兹有得，兴欲拍洪厓。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44292,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山口","author":"刘摰","text":"古渡倚双棹，萧萧秋色残。\n山川南去远，风雨北来寒。\n极望销魂易，清吟得句难。\n依稀故园梦，千里下云端。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44293,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送曾绎松滋令","author":"刘摰","text":"粹行完圭璞，谭经得圣真。\n青袍尚腰折，素蕴喜民亲。\n友益予孤陋，官闲子隐沦。\n风骚应赋古，亭下蜀江春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44294,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵耒阳邹明府庸","author":"刘摰","text":"初作南冠至，随闻墨绶来。\n犹怜百里远，时见两凫回。\n江日披梅雪，春阳动琯灰。\n论文须太白，还忆一樽开。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44295,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"泊汉口","author":"刘摰","text":"大别山前晚，维舟望古津。\n孤烟汉川树，长笛武昌人。\n珠曲今何地，兰洲欲暮春。\n文王尝美化，无复见遗民。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44296,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"舟次胡陵中秋不见月","author":"刘摰","text":"舟泊古城下，重云埋桂宫。\n旧期今夕负，清赏一年空。\n远浦依微笛，阴崖断续虫。\n篷窗强樽酒，聊更约秋风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44297,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋泊","author":"刘摰","text":"寂寞将军港，船头撞岸芦。\n寒涛能灌口，幽鸟劝提壶。\n水涨江鱼绝，秋深野菜无。\n如何晋张翰，归思为莼鲈。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44298,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梁泽雨中","author":"刘摰","text":"点细波鳞浅，声繁客袂凉。\n山烟藏晚翠，水荇濯秋香。\n帆桨无聊国，蓑轮自在乡。\n风骚已多感，更欲上潇湘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44299,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵杨郎中洙早春","author":"刘摰","text":"病客疏慵甚，江城节物新。\n东风惊柳思，暖雪斗梅春。\n老信来双鬓，闲愁著一身。\n贱贫非士耻，漉酒有陶巾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44300,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵吕书记堤上见梅花","author":"刘摰","text":"多病逢多事，穷年负物华。\n探春输野客，骑马看新花。\n南国稀江信，东风恨笛家。\n琼枝心愿见，行亦下堤沙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44301,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"潭州湘阴县万氏积庆堂","author":"刘摰","text":"庆自前人积，堂因孝子成。\n惟时传有后，于此事如生。\n乔木风烟老，佳城气象明。\n谢庭兰玉盛，知不负家声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44302,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送永州黄判官并寄丁郎中","author":"刘摰","text":"零陵古佳郡，山水楚南奇。\n太守逢康乐，佳宾得杲之。\n翩翩渐高陆，逐逐就新羁。\n别子东归去，长沙风雨时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44303,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"唐诵甥二首 其一","author":"刘摰","text":"唐生四方志，投笔慕前人。\n此日免鱼腹，异时观虎臣。\n茅柴酒亦美，玉缕鲙应珍。\n莫恨衣都典，归来是早春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44304,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"唐诵甥二首 其二","author":"刘摰","text":"因滞江州久，谓为千里遐。\n欣曾逢漂母，几欲卖朱家。\n痴坐瞻双橹，东行负九华。\n归须谈旅琐，勿作胜游誇。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44305,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵圣和秋夜对月","author":"刘摰","text":"绿桂西风老，金波玉气明。\n清霜酣夜色，群籁息秋声。\n毛骨无遗照，关河共远情。\n十年吟塞曲，画角厌悲鸣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44306,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"病起酬圣和","author":"刘摰","text":"安佚失于恃，病邪乘所虚。\n遂婴漳浦卧，便忆茂陵居。\n幸尔筋骸立，颓然鬓发疏。\n烦君山柏句，慰此不材樗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44307,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"留符离待乡信未至","author":"刘摰","text":"先陇封楸后，羁臣赐玦时。\n放舟初草草，去国合迟迟。\n珠滑新粳粒，金酣早蟹脂。\n南迁真不负，屈子独何知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44308,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"丰齐道中","author":"刘摰","text":"路远程难计，人慵马自迟。\n草蛛横布网，桑蠖乱垂丝。\n村落黄梁饭，墙篱紫菊枝。\n时丰物皆好，客思在青旗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44309,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送王子正寺祥断","author":"刘摰","text":"君仕本儒雅，故宜京国游。\n官趋廷尉府，心异法家流。\n白草侵寒驿，清霜拂晓裘。\n行行句应好，云日望神州。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44310,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"小驷送钱中道","author":"刘摰","text":"老马久劳力，主人真寡情。\n知非换妾去，颇作恋轩鸣。\n楚豆不为薄，江刍无限生。\n诚能怀旧德，时借尔山行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44311,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵王仲达龙图","author":"刘摰","text":"常慕诗之学，今逢将者才。\n讽吟真嘬炙，畏默若衔枚。\n天地秋风老，江湖醉梦回。\n韶英方合奏，难使击辕陪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44312,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"早行寄田七","author":"刘摰","text":"鞍马三更梦，江湖万里心。\n辨途听犬吠，占晓望横参。\n浩露濡衰鬓，微风动醉襟。\n输君正酣寝，鼾鼻沸雷音。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44313,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"简定国","author":"刘摰","text":"原子贫非病，张生心不盲。\n兴随缘自足，懒与拙相成。\n竹叶疑无分，金徽尚有声。\n幽怀谁晤语，空此望东城。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44314,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送席汝明","author":"刘摰","text":"得子固已晚，嗟予材滞顽。\n义合乃朋友，不在疏密间。\n江阔东风冷，梅披腊雪悭。\n扁舟共春色，相约到淮山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44315,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送计希颜","author":"刘摰","text":"翩翩远游子，驱马乱山岑。\n丹穴飞鸣处，高堂日夜心。\n春风巴峡晓，昼雾楚城阴。\n家世文章事，仙台紫桂林。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44316,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题贵池亭次蹈韵二首 其一","author":"刘摰","text":"一夜山南雪，清寒江上州。\n年华随水去，客兴为鱼留。\n闻雁思湖表，看梅寄陇头。\n樯乌风信好，紞鼓洞庭舟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44317,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题贵池亭次蹈韵二首 其二","author":"刘摰","text":"鱼味年年美，何须问旧池。\n江山清不改，陵谷变难知。\n节物惊冬至，萧条使客悲。\n谪仙游赏地，空有白猿诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44318,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"丙子元日三首 其一","author":"刘摰","text":"瑞历开三朔，祥风验八方。\n年华恨催老，节物喜随乡。\n郁垒须时设，屠苏独后尝。\n佳辰谁与醉，梦绕故溪傍。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44319,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"丙子元日三首 其二","author":"刘摰","text":"爆竹惊山鬼，雕幡戴楚冠。\n祝延千岁酒，练气五辛盘。\n江冷东风外，天回北斗端。\n羌城霖雨甚，从此看春寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44320,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"丙子元日三首 其三","author":"刘摰","text":"遥想千冠佩，朝元太极天。\n鸣鞘开殿户，索扇起炉烟。\n庆事通祥表，和声入乐悬。\n江湖祝尧意，仁寿万斯年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44321,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和吴端甫书怀","author":"刘摰","text":"旧学惊心在，穷居惜鬓华。\n诗书凭净几，水竹抱邻家。\n霜雪巴西梦，风波楚北嗟。\n知君厌留滞，我亦正尘沙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44322,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"二月二日","author":"刘摰","text":"江乡春值闰，二月似深冬。\n雪湿妨挑菜，雷寒未起龙。\n鸡虫闲得失，蛮触小交攻。\n稍觉云天霁，西山上翠峰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44323,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送僧怀善","author":"刘摰","text":"独鹤翩无累，孤云晚倦飞。\n群山带江处，一锡背尘归。\n妙学穷神秘，高怀熟世机。\n漳滨多病客，空此望岩扉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44324,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过桑八墓","author":"刘摰","text":"夫子能诗者，寒吟四十年。\n于今传好句，无处访遗编。\n古意哀东野，穷愁死玉川。\n惟馀北山冢，松柏锁秋烟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44325,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄长吉孙二首 其一","author":"刘摰","text":"别尔忽经岁，言归欣好音。\n神清率更瘦，学苦郑玄心。\n竹径依山远，沙溪过雨深。\n世科思汝父，即已御祥琴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44326,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄长吉孙二首 其二","author":"刘摰","text":"赏罢卢溪菊，来寻楚泽春。\n兰舟逾百日，椒酒值佳辰。\n勉尔青箱学，宽吾白发人。\n小园游息地，松竹更相亲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44327,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次长庚孙自汶寄诗韵","author":"刘摰","text":"近就陶家舍，扶疏草木周。\n颇移兰就水，已计竹为楼。\n饮食随宜足，光阴任自流。\n尔曹来伴老，日问下江舟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44328,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽慈圣光献皇后二首 其一","author":"刘摰","text":"四纪坤仪正，三宫册号尊。\n蚤还明辟子，坐见太平孙。\n治诰遗神几，廞衣出寝门。\n如何天下养，难驻白云轩。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44329,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽慈圣光献皇后二首 其二","author":"刘摰","text":"圣孝心崇报，宫庭诏屡颁。\n丧期逾易月，陵兆改因山。\n已想天人乐，犹睎药使还。\n蟠桃旧亭上，时节寿觞间。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44330,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽濮安懿王任夫人二首 其一","author":"刘摰","text":"自昔商任贵，于金庆裔光。\n来嫔周季历，有子汉宣皇。\n柙玉辉幽竁，车云拥画裳。\n哀荣无所憾，新庙五陵旁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44331,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽濮安懿王任夫人二首 其二","author":"刘摰","text":"卤簿三川晚，佳城一品尊。\n翟衣新襚命，神寝旧王园。\n凄断风铃远，青苍雾盖昏。\n从今知圣作，大义称私恩。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44332,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽大行太皇太后三首 其一","author":"刘摰","text":"四裔柔怀外，群生惠泽中。\n帘闱九年政，覆载一心公。\n马邓徒闻俭，姜任讵有功。\n风云黄道静，杲日上天东。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44333,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽大行太皇太后三首 其二","author":"刘摰","text":"典礼辞先后，恩私杜外门。\n虚心延众正，损上益群元。\n仙路山川近，徽音四谥尊。\n宾天去何恨，圣孝托神孙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44334,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽大行太皇太后三首 其三","author":"刘摰","text":"夕月沈金殿，秋风冷玉衣。\n临当复明辟，忽自厌繁机。\n药使来何暮，嵩呼数已非。\n孤臣恩未报，泣望国西畿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44335,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽中书侍郎懿献傅公二首 其一","author":"刘摰","text":"里闬推前辈，臣邻接近班。\n深心语默外，大节险夷间。\n付托龟趺字，哀荣马鬣山。\n遥知济源第，风月草堂闲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44336,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽中书侍郎懿献傅公二首 其二","author":"刘摰","text":"公昨初移疾，予方丐一麾。\n寻闻升屋告，适是出关时。\n零落孤龙友，绸缪记凤池。\n白头怀抱事，西望不胜悲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44337,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽右光禄大夫知枢密院事赠开府仪同三司孙公二首 其一","author":"刘摰","text":"岑令神情竭，裴公柱石衰。\n国贪黄发旧，身负赤松期。\n人也将安仰，天乎不慭遗。\n延和听诏语，深见两宫悲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44338,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽右光禄大夫知枢密院事赠开府仪同三司孙公二首 其二","author":"刘摰","text":"枢极元丰议，人犹记话言。\n载来筹庙幄，遂见偃戎轩。\n一品哀仪重，三司锡命尊。\n绸缪承晚契，挥涕望西原。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44339,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽司空文定张公二首 其一","author":"刘摰","text":"德业文章事，公乎取数多。\n虽惊坏梁梦，会有望门歌。\n人赎心徒尔，舟移古奈何。\n青编如可托，后世看巍峨。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44340,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽司空文定张公二首 其二","author":"刘摰","text":"澹泊环中妙，超遥物外仙。\n百年从委蜕，一柩戢弥天。\n晚契承知已，遗风在象贤。\n东桥松柏路，不得望新阡。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44341,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽司空赠太师申国吕公四首 其一","author":"刘摰","text":"元祐飞龙日，淮南卓马归。\n周人瞻赤舄，郑国赋缁衣。\n旷度销群异，清言析万微。\n方依泰山重，俛仰失巍巍。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44342,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽司空赠太师申国吕公四首 其二","author":"刘摰","text":"衡镜公多士，蓍龟信两宫。\n群生遂耕织，四海戢戈弓。\n夺去天何速，藏深壑已空。\n潭潭新府第，东阁闭春风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44343,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽司空赠太师申国吕公四首 其三","author":"刘摰","text":"玉辇躬临奠，金钱诏治丧。\n襚宫周尚父，世爵汉扶阳。\n位席虚群望，松阡竁旧藏。\n门中兰玉盛，有以慰思皇。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":44344,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}}]